<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Holliday returns after nine weeks of treatment. He completed the 56 doses of the intensive phase six days ago, and pyrazinamide was stopped; he now takes isoniazid, rifampin, and pyridoxine daily by video. The cultures from the third week show no growth so far, with the final reading due next week. His cough has gone, and he has gained weight. He has had no nausea, yellowing, dark urine, or numbness. He has had no alcohol for seven weeks and sees his counselor every two weeks. He is working full days. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Treatment</td><td>Intensive phase complete; continuation phase started six days ago</td></tr><tr><td>Symptoms</td><td>No cough, fever, or night sweats</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>62.5 kg, up 4.5 kg since diagnosis</td></tr><tr><td>Alcohol</td><td>None for seven weeks; AUDIT-C 1</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

